openapi: 3.1.1
  info:
    title: External Routing | v1
    description: |+
      ## ⚠️ Deprecated

      This API is **deprecated** and will be **removed on 2026-09-30**.
      Migrate to [Smart Routing | v1](https://support.peoplefone.com/en-che/api/smart-routing)
      ([OpenAPI contract](https://api.peoplefone.com/services/api-doc/api/SmartRoutingV1.yml)).

      Brief changes:
      - Base URL: `/customer/external-routing/v1/` → `/customer/smart-routing/v1/`
      - Paths: `/external-routings` → `/smart-routings`
      - Callback payload field: `externalRouting` → `smartRouting` (type `smartRouting`)

      ## 🔍 Overview

      This API manages webhook callbacks from external clients that have configured External routing through our portal.

      In order to use this API you need to generate an API Key on our Portal,and setup the External routing configuration.

      ## 📄 Documentation
      See also our documentation for more details:
      - [Smart Routing service](https://support.peoplefone.com/en-che/api/smart-routing) (replacement)
      - [API Key management](https://support.peoplefone.com/en-che/api/api-key-management)


      ### Request to your webhook URL
      * 1. When we send a request to your **webhookURL**, it is a **POST** request.

      * 2. The example request payload format is under the callbacks section of the **/external-routings/{identifier}/webhook**.

      * 3. In addition to the JSON payload, we include an **X-Track-Id** header,
      which is valid for **2 minutes** and can be used **once** to access the **/external-routings/webhook/callback** endpoint.

      ---
      ## 📌 Changelog

      ### v1.0.1 - 2026-08-20
      * Deprecated. Replaced by Smart Routing | v1. Removal planned for 2026-09-30.

      ### v1.0.0 - 2025-07-25
      * Initial release of webhook callback documentation.
